### Closed-assignment boundary

P2-05 defines closed assignments as read-only.

Preserve that behavior:
- Do not permit new attempts or explicit retries on closed assignments.
- Do not permit turn writes or lifecycle transitions for closed assignments.
- Do not automatically abandon or delete an existing unfinished attempt merely because its assignment was closed.
- Preserve its previously saved state.
- Report the resulting resume restriction clearly in the API contract.

Do not silently reopen assignments.

